This module ports OpenUI (https://github.com/thesysdev/openui) to Kotlin. The language runtime
(package `lang`) is derived from the @openuidev/lang-core package and the OpenUI Lang 1.0
specification, and the conformance fixtures in src/test/resources/fixtures were generated
with them. The component library definitions, their prompt examples and rules, and the system
prompt text (package `library`) are derived from the @openuidev/react-ui and @openuidev/lang-core
packages. The Compose components (package `components`) follow the renderers of
@openuidev/react-ui. The icon table maps lucide icon names (https://lucide.dev, ISC license)
to Material icons; no lucide artwork is included.
